      "side": 1,
      "message": "I checked the clock control driver implementation for STM32H7 (drivers/clock_control/clock_stm32_ll_h7.c). Unfortunately, it does not allow for such granular control we need in this function. Actually, it returns `-ENOTSUP` for PLL1 or HSI clock sources. So direct HAL calls are necessary for now.",
