      "writtenOn": "2026-09-17T18:33:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Following a discussion with @dawidn we had in a meeting today, I checked if any of those LL/HAL API calls can be replaced with a call to Zephyr\u0027s drivers for STM32 in their current shape.\n\nThe answer, unfortunately, is no.",
