      "writtenOn": "2026-09-15T10:40:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This looks hacky. Isn\u0027t Zephyr still supporting a change of system clock in a better way? \n\nShouldn\u0027t we at least use `sys_clock_hw_cycles_per_sec_update`?",
