      "writtenOn": "2026-09-15T12:55:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Alright, the current implementation is not only hacky but also incorrect. There\u0027s a dedicated mechanism upstream though: `CONFIG_SYSTEM_CLOCK_HW_CYCLES_PER_SEC_RUNTIME_UPDATE\u003dy` and calling `z_sys_clock_hw_cycles_per_sec_update()`. I\u0027ll use this mechanism here.\n\nThanks for catching this!",
